raries": [{"name": "react", "version": "18"}, {"name": "react-dom", "version": "18"}], "namespace": "KyivDigitalDesignSystem_728336", "sections": {}, "title": "Kyiv Digital Design System", "lastChange": {"by": "Daniil", "at": "2026-11-07T08:20:00Z", "via": "Claude", "note": "Navigation: the motion tokens are one tokens.json family, motion (was duration, easing, scale: three sidebar pages), token names unchanged; README opens with an index of the four brand-book sections (content, copywriting, motion, patterns), which the page shows as collapsible blocks at the end of Overview; motion.md wording updated. Earlier: Motion: new section motion.md («Моушн і мікроінтеракції»: principles, tokens, KD patterns, what not to do, workflow, component gaps); tokens.json families duration (11), easing (7), scale (3); example page ui_kits/kd-app/motion.html (top-up with rolling amount and toast, chip filter with collapsing rows, power status roll; speed and Reduce Motion switches); README Motion section with the rule to use the ui-motion skill for any animation, example list and Notes updated. Components unchanged (no transitions yet). Earlier: List row height: Cell and CellSelection are height auto with a 48px minimum (Figma Lists 1596:798, vertical hug + min-height 48): one line 48, with caption 62, switch 55, segmented 52. The wrapper sets height auto + minHeight 48 in Cell.jsx, CellSelection.jsx and bundle.js; Cell and CellSelection READMEs, .d.ts, index.d.ts and the README Space and layout rule updated; CellDataRow unchanged (min 40). Earlier: Rule: the screen frame is a plain 375x812 rectangle, square corners, no border, outline or shadow (README Space and layout, Shape and depth; patterns.md contract and checklist). The .phone frame (and the .state-box in main-screens) of all seven kit pages no longer has border-radius or the grey outline. Earlier: Docs: patterns.md records the missing floating glass search (Liquid Glass) field: Search exists only in the Home header and NavbarEnhanced, the bottom pill search is a one-off per page, no glass tokens or Search variant yet. Earlier: Examples: new page ui_kits/kd-app/empty-states.html with the two Figma empty states (4117:14098 list after filters, 4117:15264 search with no result), both themes; patterns.md has a new section «Empty and no-result states», register rows EmptyState and FilterDot, a values row and updated open questions; README example screens list updated. Earlier: Docs: the caption under a cell label is caption1 (12/16), as Cell draws it, not subheadline; README type table, tokens.json subheadline / caption1 usage and components/Cell/README.md corrected (code unchanged). Earlier: Toast placement rule: always at the top of the screen (under the status bar, over the navbar), never at the bottom; components/Toast/README.md and the README components table updated. Earlier: Docs: cell labels are subheadline-emphasized (15/20, 590), as in Figma cell / regular; README type table and tokens.json headline / subheadline-emphasized usage corrected (components already used it). Earlier: built the Figma frame «missed components» (4078:10105): new Badge (6 tones), Tag (regular / status), Chip (selected, 44px tap area via .kd-hit in bundle.css), Divider (inset), Select (real <select> opening the platform menu) and TextField multiline (growing textarea); shared internal FieldFrame; README, patterns.md, index.d.ts and component docs updated. Earlier: new Card component (layout: padding list/regular/large/none, gap, caption, elevated, onClick) derived from the shipped Group/Section/FieldCard/ItemCard blocks; NavbarRegular and NavbarEnhanced slots are now real 44px buttons (onBack, onClose, leadingAction, trailingAction, transparent) via internal NavbarSlot; kit pages migrated to both, dead CSS removed; README, patterns.md and component docs updated. Earlier: moved the Content block out of README.md into its own section, content.md («Content and copy»); README keeps a one-line pointer. Earlier: patterns.md: added the Native first section (native alerts, menus, pickers, share and system sheets over custom look-alikes) and aligned the contract, the custom steps, Pick from a list and the checklist with it. Earlier: removed the archived/ folder (28 files of the previous system generation: old README, bundle, specimen cards, tokens, UI kit). Earlier: fixed clipped icons, Figma-exported glyph svgs now draw their ~1px outline overflow (rule in components/bundle.css)"}}